{"title":"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Due to the categories of some tests being changed, the tests are organized by year. Click on a year's link to view all of the contest categories for that year. Note that for earlier contests, some test papers may have not been available.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#1960_to_1969\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">1960 to 1969</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#1970_to_1979\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">1970 to 1979</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#1980_to_1989\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">1980 to 1989</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#1990_to_1999\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">1990 to 1999</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#2000_to_2009\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2000 to 2009</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#2010_to_2019\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2010 to 2019</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#2020_to_2029\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">2020 to 2029</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1960_to_1969\">1960 to 1969</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: 1960 to 1969\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1964 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1964 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1965 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1965 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1966 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1966 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1967 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1967 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1968 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1968 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1969 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1969 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1970_to_1979\">1970 to 1979</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions&amp;action=edit&amp;